  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  instructions:
  - Speed is everything, the sky is the limit.
  - Win Races to get higher ranks.
  - Beat your best time in time trial mode.
  - Be the champ in last man standing.
  - At high speed every decision is a life or death.
  - Perform high risk to get high rewards.
  - Get the thrill of chasing Horses.
  - "Either you\u2019re a legend, or you\u2019re nobody."
  - Blast through obstacles in the racing zone.
  textTypeWriter: {fileID: 6638880260582092224}
